FLWTM1,	ZBLOCK	2		/FLAW TABLE RECORD TEMPORARY
FLWTM2,	ZBLOCK	2		/FLAW TABLE RECORD TEMPORARY
MWLGMAX,-LMAXLO;-LMAXHI-1	/-(LOGICAL MAXIMUM RECORD ON WINCHESTER)
