JANENT,	31			/31 DAYS IN JANUARY
FEBENT,	28			/THIS IS 29 IN LEAPING YEARS
	31			/31 DAYS IN MARCH
	30			/30 DAYS IN APRIL
	31			/31 DAYS IN MAY
	30			/30 DAYS IN JUNE
	31			/31 DAYS IN JULY
	31			/31 DAYS IN AUGUST
	30			/30 DAYS IN SEPTEMBER
