	INITIAL				/TRANSFER ADDRESS
VBTFUN,	2^100+PRGFLD+.-.		/UNIT BITS WILL BE FILLED IN
	RWBLK				/RECORD POINTER
	JMP	WBTBAD			/JUMP IF I/O ERROR
	TAD	[-BLKSIZE]		/SETUP THE
